{"id":"ruhig","lemma":"ruhig","pos":"adv","rank":291,"glosses":["quietly","calmly","used to indicate that the speaker does not object to the actions of others"],"ipa":"/ˈʁuː.ɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/De-ruhig.ogg/De-ruhig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Kannst du bitte ruhig sein?","en":"Can you please be quiet?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567133","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"please"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Es war wieder ruhig.","en":"It was quiet again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390531","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"again"},null]},{"text":"Warum ist es so ruhig?","en":"Why is it so quiet?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Sie sind ruhig.","en":"They're quiet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/138180","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sei ruhig und hör mir zu.","en":"Be quiet and listen to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566704","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to / too"}]}]}